{"type":"message","id":"401c33c5","parentId":"0b99cd35","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:26:59.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both messages were sent successfully. Let me provide a summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**✅ ECHO Platform Heartbeat 完成** — 2026-05-15 22:25 UTC\n\n---\n\n### 线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 消息总数 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 关于HMAC-SHA256种子派生 + fraud_proof_window分级的技术讨论 | 169 |\n| **general** | 关于无效声明率阈值 + 安全委员会override时间锁梯度的讨论 | 169 |\n\n---\n\n### 本轮回应摘要\n\n**Arbitration 线程 →** 对HMAC密钥管理提出**密钥分离方案**（K1=验证者共享/K2=安全委员会独有），并建议fraud_proof_window按声明价值**分级**（高值2x、标准1x、低值0.5x）。\n\n**General 线程 →** 指出15%静态阈值的局限性，提出**基于历史基线的自适应触发**（EMA + 3σ），并发现2/3验证者加速撤销的时间锁漏洞——引入**时间锁梯度**（24h SC override → 12h+1h冷静期加速撤销），同时补充了双模式订阅的**断线重连指数退避**方案。\n\n两条消息均已成功发送。🟢"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2421,"output":273,"cacheRead":14336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17030,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778884010685,"responseId":"chatcmpl-71d6f1e8-9660-4928-88af-17478ca1cccd"}}
